Enterprise Migration Sandbox & Digital Twin Implementation
Objective

Redesign and transform the existing Migration Sandbox into an Enterprise-Grade Real-Time Post-Quantum Migration Simulation Platform.

This module must not be a static demo or fake simulator.

Instead, it must automatically build a Digital Twin of the customer's cryptographic environment using the actual discovered assets, CBOM, Crypto Inventory, telemetry, dependency graph, certificates, policies, and runtime metadata.

The Migration Sandbox must allow organizations to safely simulate an entire post-quantum cryptographic migration without making changes to production infrastructure.

The final implementation must be suitable for large enterprises, governments, financial institutions, healthcare organizations, cloud providers, and regulated industries.

Core Vision

The Migration Sandbox is the "flight simulator" of QGuard Helix.

Just as pilots train before flying an aircraft, organizations should fully validate every cryptographic migration before touching production.

Nothing in production should ever be modified during simulation.

Only metadata, configurations, relationships, certificates, cryptographic inventory, and runtime telemetry are cloned into a Digital Twin.

